{
  "esm": "1.0.0",
  "metadata": {
    "name": "MicrophysicsColumn",
    "description": "One sub-time step of the WSM6 microphysics of the EqWeather reference suite (WRF mp_physics = 6) assembled from the stage components in components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6, mounted by reference as top-level systems and coupled in the order mp_wsm6_run calls them with variable_map/param_to_var edges (esm-spec 10.4): WSM6Saturation (the start-of-sub-step qsat/rh/xl/cpm) -> WSM6MeltingFreezing (psmlt, pgmlt, pimlt, pihmf, pihtf, pgfrz as an in-place increment block, whose output IS the state at which the process rates are evaluated) -> WSM6WarmRain (praut, pracw, prevp) and WSM6ColdAccretion (the 11 collection terms) and WSM6IceDeposition (the sequential vapor budget pidep -> psdep -> pgdep -> pigen, psaut, pgaut, psevp, pgevp, opened by WarmRain's prevp) -> WSM6MassConservation (the budget rescaling and the state update it feeds) -> WSM6SaturationAdjustment (pcond at the updated state). Each stage keeps its `input_<x>` rewrite targets for standalone testing; here the mount-edge libraries couplings/tests/wsm6_couple_*_inputs.esm lower them to the stages' additive `<x>_in` coupling-target parameters, which the document's coupling fills from the upstream stage, including the parameters of the hydrometeor_slopes.esm subsystem `sd` that ColdAccretion, IceDeposition and MeltingFreezing mount (Cold.sd.qr_in and friends) and of the saturation.esm subsystem `sat` that SaturationAdjustment mounts. WHAT IS NOT IN THE CHAIN, and why: WSM6's sedimentation is not a rate. The kernel moves rain, snow, graupel and cloud ice with a semi-Lagrangian PLM update (nislfv_rain_plm/plm6) whose increment at the WRF sub-step differs from the donor-cell flux divergence that sedimentation.esm exposes by factors 0.4-1.6, with sign flips for snow and graupel; the two agree only in the dt -> 0 limit. There is therefore no rate that WSM6Sedimentation could hand to WSM6MeltingFreezing, and the chain starts one stage later: the post-sedimentation column state entering MeltingFreezing is a dumped profile (reconstructed from the dump's water and energy budgets, as in melting_freezing.esm's own tests), and everything downstream of it -- six of the seven stages of the sub-step -- is coupled. This is the largest sub-chain of the sub-step that is expressible as one coupled document. The other two dumped inputs are the vapor mixing ratio, the pressure and the density, which no stage of the chain changes (WSM6 updates q only in the mass-conservation block, whose own q_upd IS coupled onward into the saturation adjustment). The saturation stage is deliberately NOT recomputed downstream: WSM6 evaluates qsat, rh, xl and cpm once per sub-step from the START-of-sub-step temperature and vapor and keeps them while sedimentation, melting and freezing change t (FORTRAN_BUGS.md note N4), so WSM6Saturation is mounted on the entry state and its outputs are coupled into every later stage, exactly reproducing that staging. Nothing in the chain is rate x dt: the per-process limiters scale with 1/dtcld, the melting/freezing block and the saturation adjustment are instantaneous adjustments, and the mass-conservation factors are 1 only in the dtcld -> 0 limit (note N3), so the document is compared with the kernel at ITS sub-step (dtcld = 12 s) rather than replayed at a small dt. One document holds one column state (one regime); the mixed-phase companion is couplings/microphysics_column_mixed.esm. KNOWN BINDING LIMITATIONS (Rust CLI, EarthSciAST issue #198): the mounted components' own inline tests are re-run inside this document under the coupling and error, so run `./esm test --model MicrophysicsColumn couplings/microphysics_column.esm`; the leaves' index sets are redeclared at document level because a top-level ref mount does not merge them; and a parent test cannot set a mounted component's parameter, so the sub-step length is prescribed in this model and coupled in.",
    "license": "MIT",
    "tags": ["assembly", "coupling", "microphysics", "wsm6", "wrf"],
    "references": [
      { "citation": "Hong, S.-Y., and J.-O. J. Lim (2006). The WRF single-moment 6-class microphysics scheme (WSM6). J. Korean Meteor. Soc. 42, 129-151." },
      { "citation": "NCAR/MMM-physics mp_wsm6.F90 at commit 550b5b4 (WRF 4.8 phys/physics_mmm submodule)." }
    ]
  },
  "metaparameters": {
    "NLEV": { "type": "integer", "default": 40, "description": "Declared at document level because a top-level ref mount does not merge the leaf's index_sets (EarthSciAST issue #198); bound into every mount edge whose leaf declares it. Number of model layers (WRF kte); 40 for the em_quarter_ss supercell column." }
  },
  "index_sets": {
    "lev": { "kind": "interval", "size": "NLEV" }
  },
  "models": {
    "Sat": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/saturation.esm",
      "bindings": { "NLEV": "NLEV" },
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_column_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "Melt": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/melting_freezing.esm",
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_column_inputs.esm" },
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_couple_melt_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "Warm": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/warm_rain.esm",
      "bindings": { "NLEV": "NLEV" },
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_ambient_inputs.esm" },
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_couple_warm_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "Cold": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/cold_accretion.esm",
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_ambient_inputs.esm" },
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_couple_cold_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "IceDep": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/ice_deposition.esm",
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_ambient_inputs.esm" },
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_couple_icedep_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "Rescale": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/mass_conservation.esm",
      "bindings": { "NLEV": "NLEV" },
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_ambient_inputs.esm" },
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_couple_rescale_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "SatAdj": {
      "ref": "../components/atmospheric_dynamics/wsm6/saturation_adjustment.esm",
      "expression_template_imports": [
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_step250_col24_pressure_inputs.esm" },
        { "ref": "./tests/wsm6_couple_satadj_inputs.esm" }
      ]
    },
    "MicrophysicsColumn": {
      "variables": {
        "dtcld0": { "type": "parameter", "units": "s", "default": 12.0, "description": "Prescribed: length of the WSM6 sub-time step (WRF dtcld = delt when delt <= dtcldcr)." },
        "dtcld": { "type": "unknown", "units": "s", "description": "Sub-step length as a variable, so that it can be coupled into every mounted stage (a parent test cannot set a mounted component's parameter, EarthSciAST issue #198)." },
        "xl_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "J/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Sat.xl through the coupling." },
        "xl": { "type": "unknown", "units": "J/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Latent heat of vaporization at the start-of-sub-step temperature." },
        "cpm_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "J/(kg*K)", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Sat.cpm through the coupling." },
        "cpm": { "type": "unknown", "units": "J/(kg*K)", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Moist heat capacity at the start-of-sub-step vapor." },
        "qsat_w_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Sat.qsat_w through the coupling." },
        "qsat_w": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Saturation mixing ratio over water at the start-of-sub-step state." },
        "rh_w_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Sat.rh_w through the coupling." },
        "rh_w": { "type": "unknown", "units": "1", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Relative humidity over water at the start-of-sub-step state." },
        "melt_T_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "K", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Melt.T_out through the coupling." },
        "melt_T": { "type": "unknown", "units": "K", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Temperature after the melting/freezing block, i.e. the state at which the process rates are evaluated (WSM6 t_rates)." },
        "melt_qc_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Melt.qc_out through the coupling." },
        "melt_qc": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Cloud water at the rate-evaluation state (WSM6 qc_rates)." },
        "melt_qi_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Melt.qi_out through the coupling." },
        "melt_qi": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Cloud ice at the rate-evaluation state (WSM6 qi_rates)." },
        "melt_qr_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Melt.qr_out through the coupling." },
        "melt_qr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Rain at the rate-evaluation state (WSM6 qr_rates)." },
        "melt_qs_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Melt.qs_out through the coupling." },
        "melt_qs": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Snow at the rate-evaluation state (WSM6 qs_rates)." },
        "melt_qg_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Melt.qg_out through the coupling." },
        "melt_qg": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Graupel at the rate-evaluation state (WSM6 qg_rates)." },
        "praut_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Warm.praut_lim through the coupling." },
        "praut": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Autoconversion of cloud water to rain, after its own limiter (WSM6 praut_raw)." },
        "pracw_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Warm.pracw_lim through the coupling." },
        "pracw": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud water by rain (WSM6 pracw_raw)." },
        "prevp_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Warm.prevp_lim through the coupling." },
        "prevp": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Evaporation/condensation of rain (WSM6 prevp_raw); also the term that opens the ice deposition budget." },
        "praci_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.praci_lim through the coupling." },
        "praci": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud ice by rain (WSM6 praci_raw)." },
        "piacr_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.piacr_lim through the coupling." },
        "piacr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by cloud ice (WSM6 piacr_raw)." },
        "psaci_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.psaci_lim through the coupling." },
        "psaci": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud ice by snow (WSM6 psaci_raw)." },
        "pgaci_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.pgaci_lim through the coupling." },
        "pgaci": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud ice by graupel (WSM6 pgaci_raw)." },
        "psacr_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.psacr_lim through the coupling." },
        "psacr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by snow (WSM6 psacr_raw)." },
        "pgacr_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.pgacr_lim through the coupling." },
        "pgacr": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by graupel (WSM6 pgacr_raw)." },
        "paacw_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Cold.paacw through the coupling." },
        "paacw": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud water by the mixing-ratio-weighted mean snow/graupel distribution (WSM6 paacw_raw)." },
        "pidep_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives IceDep.pidep_lim through the coupling." },
        "pidep": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Deposition/sublimation of cloud ice, first term of WSM6's sequential vapor budget (WSM6 pidep_raw)." },
        "psdep_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives IceDep.psdep_lim through the coupling." },
        "psdep": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Deposition/sublimation of snow (WSM6 psdep_raw)." },
        "pgdep_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives IceDep.pgdep_lim through the coupling." },
        "pgdep": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Deposition/sublimation of graupel (WSM6 pgdep_raw)." },
        "pigen_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives IceDep.pigen_lim through the coupling." },
        "pigen": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Nucleation of cloud ice from vapor, last term of the sequential vapor budget (WSM6 pigen_raw)." },
        "psaut_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives IceDep.psaut through the coupling." },
        "psaut": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Aggregation of cloud ice to snow (WSM6 psaut_raw)." },
        "pgaut_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives IceDep.pgaut_lim through the coupling." },
        "pgaut": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Aggregation of snow to graupel (WSM6 pgaut_raw)." },
        "prevp_final_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.prevp_final through the coupling." },
        "prevp_final": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Rain evaporation after the mass-conservation rescaling (WSM6 prevp_final)." },
        "piacr_final_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.piacr_final through the coupling." },
        "piacr_final": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by cloud ice after the rescaling (WSM6 piacr_final)." },
        "psacr_final_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.psacr_final through the coupling." },
        "psacr_final": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by snow after the rescaling (WSM6 psacr_final)." },
        "pgacr_final_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.pgacr_final through the coupling." },
        "pgacr_final": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of rain by graupel after the rescaling (WSM6 pgacr_final)." },
        "psaci_final_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.psaci_final through the coupling." },
        "psaci_final": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Accretion of cloud ice by snow after the rescaling (WSM6 psaci_final)." },
        "pidep_final_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.pidep_final through the coupling." },
        "pidep_final": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Ice deposition after the rescaling (WSM6 pidep_final)." },
        "T_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "K", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.T_upd through the coupling." },
        "T_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "K", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Temperature after the rate update, before the saturation adjustment (WSM6 t_upd)." },
        "qv_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.qv_upd through the coupling." },
        "qv_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Vapor after the rate update (WSM6 q_upd)." },
        "qc_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.qc_upd through the coupling." },
        "qc_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Cloud water after the rate update (WSM6 qc_upd)." },
        "qi_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.qi_upd through the coupling." },
        "qi_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Cloud ice after the rate update (WSM6 qi_upd)." },
        "qr_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.qr_upd through the coupling." },
        "qr_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Rain after the rate update (WSM6 qr_upd)." },
        "qs_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.qs_upd through the coupling." },
        "qs_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Snow after the rate update (WSM6 qs_upd)." },
        "qg_upd_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives Rescale.qg_upd through the coupling." },
        "qg_upd": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Graupel after the rate update (WSM6 qg_upd)." },
        "pcond_in": { "type": "parameter", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "default": 0.0, "description": "Receives SatAdj.pcond through the coupling." },
        "pcond": { "type": "unknown", "units": "kg/kg/s", "shape": ["lev"], "description": "Saturation-adjustment condensation/evaporation rate at the updated state, the last step of the sub-step (WSM6 pcond)." }
      },
      "equations": [
        { "lhs": "dtcld", "rhs": "dtcld0" },
        { "lhs": "xl", "rhs": "xl_in" },
        { "lhs": "cpm", "rhs": "cpm_in" },
        { "lhs": "qsat_w", "rhs": "qsat_w_in" },
        { "lhs": "rh_w", "rhs": "rh_w_in" },
        { "lhs": "melt_T", "rhs": "melt_T_in" },
        { "lhs": "melt_qc", "rhs": "melt_qc_in" },
        { "lhs": "melt_qi", "rhs": "melt_qi_in" },
        { "lhs": "melt_qr", "rhs": "melt_qr_in" },
        { "lhs": "melt_qs", "rhs": "melt_qs_in" },
        { "lhs": "melt_qg", "rhs": "melt_qg_in" },
        { "lhs": "praut", "rhs": "praut_in" },
        { "lhs": "pracw", "rhs": "pracw_in" },
        { "lhs": "prevp", "rhs": "prevp_in" },
        { "lhs": "praci", "rhs": "praci_in" },
        { "lhs": "piacr", "rhs": "piacr_in" },
        { "lhs": "psaci", "rhs": "psaci_in" },
        { "lhs": "pgaci", "rhs": "pgaci_in" },
        { "lhs": "psacr", "rhs": "psacr_in" },
        { "lhs": "pgacr", "rhs": "pgacr_in" },
        { "lhs": "paacw", "rhs": "paacw_in" },
        { "lhs": "pidep", "rhs": "pidep_in" },
        { "lhs": "psdep", "rhs": "psdep_in" },
        { "lhs": "pgdep", "rhs": "pgdep_in" },
        { "lhs": "pigen", "rhs": "pigen_in" },
        { "lhs": "psaut", "rhs": "psaut_in" },
        { "lhs": "pgaut", "rhs": "pgaut_in" },
        { "lhs": "prevp_final", "rhs": "prevp_final_in" },
        { "lhs": "piacr_final", "rhs": "piacr_final_in" },
        { "lhs": "psacr_final", "rhs": "psacr_final_in" },
        { "lhs": "pgacr_final", "rhs": "pgacr_final_in" },
        { "lhs": "psaci_final", "rhs": "psaci_final_in" },
        { "lhs": "pidep_final", "rhs": "pidep_final_in" },
        { "lhs": "T_upd", "rhs": "T_upd_in" },
        { "lhs": "qv_upd", "rhs": "qv_upd_in" },
        { "lhs": "qc_upd", "rhs": "qc_upd_in" },
        { "lhs": "qi_upd", "rhs": "qi_upd_in" },
        { "lhs": "qr_upd", "rhs": "qr_upd_in" },
        { "lhs": "qs_upd", "rhs": "qs_upd_in" },
        { "lhs": "qg_upd", "rhs": "qg_upd_in" },
        { "lhs": "pcond", "rhs": "pcond_in" }
      ],
      "tests": []
    }
  },
  "coupling": [
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "MicrophysicsColumn.dtcld", "to": "Melt.dtcld", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "shared sub-step length into the melting/freezing block" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "MicrophysicsColumn.dtcld", "to": "Warm.dtcld", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "shared sub-step length into the warm-rain limiters" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "MicrophysicsColumn.dtcld", "to": "Cold.dtcld", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "shared sub-step length into the collection limiters" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "MicrophysicsColumn.dtcld", "to": "IceDep.dtcld", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "shared sub-step length into the vapor budget" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "MicrophysicsColumn.dtcld", "to": "Rescale.dtcld", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "shared sub-step length into the mass-conservation block" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "MicrophysicsColumn.dtcld", "to": "SatAdj.dtcld", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "shared sub-step length into the saturation adjustment" },

    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.cpm", "to": "Melt.cpm_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step cpm into the melting/freezing block" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.xl", "to": "Melt.xl_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step xl into the melting/freezing block" },

    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.T_out", "to": "Warm.T_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing temperature into the warm-rain rates" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qc_out", "to": "Warm.qc_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing cloud water into the warm-rain rates" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qr_out", "to": "Warm.qr_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing rain into the warm-rain rates" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.qsat_w", "to": "Warm.qsat_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step qsat over water into the warm-rain rates" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.rh_w", "to": "Warm.rh_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step rh over water into the warm-rain rates" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.xl", "to": "Warm.xl_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step xl into the warm-rain rates" },

    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qc_out", "to": "Cold.qc_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing cloud water into the collection terms" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.T_out", "to": "Cold.sd.T_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing temperature into the collection terms' size distributions" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qi_out", "to": "Cold.sd.qi_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing cloud ice into the collection terms' size distributions" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qr_out", "to": "Cold.sd.qr_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing rain into the collection terms' size distributions" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qs_out", "to": "Cold.sd.qs_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing snow into the collection terms' size distributions" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qg_out", "to": "Cold.sd.qg_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing graupel into the collection terms' size distributions" },

    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.T_out", "to": "IceDep.sd.T_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing temperature into the deposition size distributions" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qi_out", "to": "IceDep.sd.qi_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing cloud ice into the deposition size distributions" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qr_out", "to": "IceDep.sd.qr_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing rain into the deposition size distributions" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qs_out", "to": "IceDep.sd.qs_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing snow into the deposition size distributions" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qg_out", "to": "IceDep.sd.qg_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "post-melting/freezing graupel into the deposition size distributions" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.qsat_w", "to": "IceDep.qsat_w_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step qsat over water into the deposition chain" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.rh_w", "to": "IceDep.rh_w_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step rh over water into the deposition chain" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.qsat_i", "to": "IceDep.qsat_i_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step qsat over ice into the deposition chain" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.rh_i", "to": "IceDep.rh_i_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step rh over ice into the deposition chain" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.xl", "to": "IceDep.xl_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step xl into the deposition chain" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Warm.prevp_lim", "to": "IceDep.prevp_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "rain evaporation opens WSM6's sequential vapor budget" },

    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.T_out", "to": "Rescale.T_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "rate-evaluation temperature into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qc_out", "to": "Rescale.qc_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "rate-evaluation cloud water into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qi_out", "to": "Rescale.qi_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "rate-evaluation cloud ice into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qr_out", "to": "Rescale.qr_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "rate-evaluation rain into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qs_out", "to": "Rescale.qs_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "rate-evaluation snow into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qg_out", "to": "Rescale.qg_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "rate-evaluation graupel into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.xl", "to": "Rescale.xl_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step xl into the latent heating of the update" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.cpm", "to": "Rescale.cpm_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step cpm into the latent heating of the update" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Warm.praut_lim", "to": "Rescale.praut_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "praut into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Warm.pracw_lim", "to": "Rescale.pracw_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "pracw into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Warm.prevp_lim", "to": "Rescale.prevp_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "prevp into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Cold.praci_lim", "to": "Rescale.praci_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "praci into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Cold.piacr_lim", "to": "Rescale.piacr_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "piacr into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Cold.psaci_lim", "to": "Rescale.psaci_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "psaci into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Cold.pgaci_lim", "to": "Rescale.pgaci_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "pgaci into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Cold.pracs_lim", "to": "Rescale.pracs_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "pracs into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Cold.psacr_lim", "to": "Rescale.psacr_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "psacr into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Cold.pgacr_lim", "to": "Rescale.pgacr_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "pgacr into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Cold.pgacs", "to": "Rescale.pgacs_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "pgacs into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Cold.pseml_lim", "to": "Rescale.pseml_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "pseml into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Cold.pgeml_lim", "to": "Rescale.pgeml_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "pgeml into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Cold.paacw", "to": "Rescale.paacw_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "paacw into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "IceDep.psdep_lim", "to": "Rescale.psdep_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "psdep into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "IceDep.pgdep_lim", "to": "Rescale.pgdep_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "pgdep into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "IceDep.pidep_lim", "to": "Rescale.pidep_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "pidep into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "IceDep.pigen_lim", "to": "Rescale.pigen_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "pigen into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "IceDep.psaut", "to": "Rescale.psaut_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "psaut into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "IceDep.pgaut_lim", "to": "Rescale.pgaut_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "pgaut into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "IceDep.psevp_lim", "to": "Rescale.psevp_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "psevp into the budget check" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "IceDep.pgevp_lim", "to": "Rescale.pgevp_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "pgevp into the budget check" },

    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Rescale.T_upd", "to": "SatAdj.sat.T_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "updated temperature re-enters the saturation state of the adjustment" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Rescale.qv_upd", "to": "SatAdj.sat.qv_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "updated vapor re-enters the saturation state of the adjustment" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Rescale.qc_upd", "to": "SatAdj.qc_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "updated cloud water into the saturation adjustment" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.xl", "to": "SatAdj.xl_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step xl into the saturation adjustment" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.cpm", "to": "SatAdj.cpm_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "start-of-sub-step cpm into the saturation adjustment" },

    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.xl", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.xl_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Sat.xl" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.cpm", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.cpm_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Sat.cpm" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.qsat_w", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.qsat_w_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Sat.qsat_w" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Sat.rh_w", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.rh_w_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Sat.rh_w" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.T_out", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.melt_T_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Melt.T_out" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qc_out", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.melt_qc_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Melt.qc_out" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qi_out", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.melt_qi_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Melt.qi_out" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qr_out", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.melt_qr_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Melt.qr_out" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qs_out", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.melt_qs_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Melt.qs_out" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Melt.qg_out", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.melt_qg_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Melt.qg_out" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Warm.praut_lim", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.praut_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Warm.praut_lim" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Warm.pracw_lim", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.pracw_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Warm.pracw_lim" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Warm.prevp_lim", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.prevp_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Warm.prevp_lim" },
    { "type": "variable_map", "from": "Cold.praci_lim", "to": "MicrophysicsColumn.praci_in", "transform": "param_to_var", "description": "expose Cold.praci_lim" },
